    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 20,
      "ordinal": 18,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0153",
      "sourceText": "それじゃついてきてくれ、ユーリ。詳しいことは歩きながら話そう",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_subaru01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 17,
      "ordinal": 32,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0271p5",
      "sourceText": "……なんじゃ？\n合言葉を知っとるのに見ない顔じゃな",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 19,
      "ordinal": 34,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0280",
      "sourceText": "ええい、待たんか。お前さん、いったい何者じゃ？",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 21,
      "ordinal": 36,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0289",
      "sourceText": "ふむ……取引、か。いささか怪しい風体じゃが……まあ、いいじゃろう。入れ",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 24,
      "ordinal": 39,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0303",
      "sourceText": "……妙な連中じゃな",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 26,
      "ordinal": 40,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0310",
      "sourceText": "お前さん、新顔じゃろう。どこでここの合言葉を聞いたんじゃ",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 28,
      "ordinal": 42,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0322",
      "sourceText": "ずいぶんと前のめりにくるもんじゃのう",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 29,
      "ordinal": 43,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0342",
      "sourceText": "銀髪……？\nそんな悪目立ちするもんは見とらんぞ",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 31,
      "ordinal": 45,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0351",
      "sourceText": "独り言が多いの奴じゃの……。\nそしてそっちの若造は無口ときておる。\n何者じゃ？",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 33,
      "ordinal": 47,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0378",
      "sourceText": "お前さんら、どうにも怪しいのう……\nその袋の中身も得体が知れんが……ん？\nこりゃ食い物か？",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 35,
      "ordinal": 49,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0395",
      "sourceText": "なんじゃ、ケチくさい。それで、結局、何の取引が目的なんじゃ",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 37,
      "ordinal": 51,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0421",
      "sourceText": "今の段階でそんな約束なぞできん。早く話を進めたいなら、それこそとっとと本題に入ることじゃな",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 7,
      "ordinal": 56,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0460",
      "sourceText": "ふん、わけありじゃの。フェルトの仕事まで知っとるなら、話が早いわい",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 8,
      "ordinal": 57,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0466",
      "sourceText": "じゃがその徽章、上物と聞いとるぞ。\nお前さんなんぞに、買い取れるのか？",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 9,
      "ordinal": 58,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0492",
      "sourceText": "ふむ、妥当な話ではあるのう。じゃが、何を交渉する？",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 14,
      "ordinal": 63,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0520",
      "sourceText": "ふむ……高値がつくのは間違いないの。フェルトが持ち込む品物とも、十分、取引する価値はあるじゃろう",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 19,
      "ordinal": 68,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0562",
      "sourceText": "構わんが、辺りのものに触るでないぞ。それと、何も出さんからな",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 24,
      "ordinal": 72,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0586",
      "sourceText": "おっと、きたようじゃな。ちと外すぞい",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 32,
      "ordinal": 80,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0625",
      "sourceText": "はー、疲れた疲れた。\nったく、あの姉ちゃんしつこいったら\nねーっての……って、ああ？",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 33,
      "ordinal": 81,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0630p5",
      "sourceText": "なんだよ、この兄ちゃんたちは。先客がいるなんて聞いてね一ぞ",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 34,
      "ordinal": 82,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0636",
      "sourceText": "それなんじゃがな。連中はお前さんの客じゃよ、客",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_rom01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 35,
      "ordinal": 83,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0644",
      "sourceText": "はーん。ま、話はわかったよ。けど、いきなりこられても困んだよな",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 36,
      "ordinal": 84,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0649",
      "sourceText": "アタシにアンタらの頼みを聞く義理は\nねーんだ。それぐらいわかってんだろ？",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 37,
      "ordinal": 85,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0673",
      "sourceText": "うまい話ってのは、兄ちゃんたちが信用できる相手だったらの話だろ",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 38,
      "ordinal": 86,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0677",
      "sourceText": "そっちのアンタはどう思ってんだ？交渉下手な相方に任せっきりかよ？",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 41,
      "ordinal": 89,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0696",
      "sourceText": "ハッ、気取った物言いが気に入らねーが、\nアタシもそいつと同意見だよ",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 43,
      "ordinal": 91,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0705",
      "sourceText": "お互い、わかり合えねーって同意したんだ。\nそしたら、話はしまいだろ？\nとっととアンタらは……",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 45,
      "ordinal": 93,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0718",
      "sourceText": "ああ?",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 48,
      "ordinal": 96,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0734",
      "sourceText": "……は、わかったぜ。最初から気に食わね一雰囲気だと思ってたんだが、ピンときた",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 49,
      "ordinal": 97,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0740",
      "sourceText": "とっとと失せろよ、騎士様、貴族様。テメーらと話すロは、アタシにはねー！",
      "confirmedCharacter": "live2d/AC_felt01",
      "unchanged": true
    }
  ],
