      "ordinal": 3,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0054",
      "sourceText": "しかし、君一人の\n目撃証言だけではな……",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 6,
      "ordinal": 4,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0060",
      "sourceText": "ならばこそ、真実かどうか確かめねばならないのではないかな？",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 8,
      "ordinal": 6,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0068",
      "sourceText": "君は何故、私の名前を？\nどこかで会ったことがあっただろうか？",
      "classification": "source_visibility_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 10,
      "ordinal": 8,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0079",
      "sourceText": "有名になるのも考え物だな。\nそれで、君は我々に何を望む？",
      "classification": "source_visibility_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 11,
      "ordinal": 9,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0102",
      "sourceText": "なるほど、よほどの事情があるらしい。私を頼ってのことならなおさらだ。いいだろう、引き受けよう",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 12,
      "ordinal": 10,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0108",
      "sourceText": "ユリウス殿が行かれるほどのことでは……。\nここは我々が！",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 13,
      "ordinal": 11,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0113",
      "sourceText": "彼は私を頼ってきている。君たちは君たちの職務を果たしてくれ。必要があれば、必ず声をかける",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 14,
      "ordinal": 12,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0120",
      "sourceText": "はっ!",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 17,
      "ordinal": 15,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0135",
      "sourceText": "ふむ。珍しい服だ。興味深い。しばらく借り受けることにしよう",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040051,
      "scenarioId": 19,
      "ordinal": 17,
      "stableKey": "s10040051-p29-at0147",
      "sourceText": "そこまで考えているとは恐れ入るな。わかった。これから、私はただのユーリだ",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 4,
      "ordinal": 19,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0171",
      "sourceText": "なるほど……事情は理解した。話の通りならば、それは『腸狩り』のエルザだろう",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 5,
      "ordinal": 20,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0177",
      "sourceText": "『腸狩り』……改めて聞いても、物騒な異名だな……",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 6,
      "ordinal": 21,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0181",
      "sourceText": "他者の腹を切り裂いて殺す。その殺人の手口から付いた異名だよ",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 7,
      "ordinal": 22,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0186",
      "sourceText": "ああ、恐ろしく腕の立つ女だったからな。人を殺すのを何とも思ってねえ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 8,
      "ordinal": 23,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0192",
      "sourceText": "……不安は隠せないようだね",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 9,
      "ordinal": 24,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0195",
      "sourceText": "とんでもなくヤバい奴がいるところに、わざわざいくってんだから、当然だろ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 10,
      "ordinal": 25,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0201",
      "sourceText": "だが、それを承知で、君は私を案内している。その行為は、素直に賞賛に値する",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 11,
      "ordinal": 26,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0207",
      "sourceText": "そう言ってくれると、助かる。\nっと、ここが盗品蔵だ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 12,
      "ordinal": 27,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0212",
      "sourceText": "いかにも、といったところだなさて、『腸狩り』はこの近くに?",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 13,
      "ordinal": 28,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0217",
      "sourceText": "ここで取引するって話らしい。先に店の中で待たせてもらおうぜ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 14,
      "ordinal": 29,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0223",
      "sourceText": "「大鼠に」",
      "classification": "no_visible_stage_actor_at_selected_choice_frame",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 15,
      "ordinal": 30,
