      "sourceText": "「白鯨に」",
      "classification": "no_visible_stage_actor_at_selected_choice_frame",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 16,
      "ordinal": 31,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0251",
      "sourceText": "「我らが貴きドラゴン様に」",
      "classification": "no_visible_stage_actor_at_selected_choice_frame",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 18,
      "ordinal": 33,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0276",
      "sourceText": "よう、爺さん。ちょっと上がらせてもらうぜ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 20,
      "ordinal": 35,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0284",
      "sourceText": "名乗るほどのものじゃねぇよ。\nだが心配すんな、取引にきただけだ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 22,
      "ordinal": 37,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0294p5",
      "sourceText": "恩に着るぜ。ほら、いくぞ、ユーリ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 23,
      "ordinal": 38,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0299",
      "sourceText": "ああ、わかった。すまないな、ご老人",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 27,
      "ordinal": 41,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0315",
      "sourceText": "蛇の道は蛇っつ一か、そこは企業秘密ってことにしといてくれ。それより、取引の話がしたい",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 30,
      "ordinal": 44,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0346",
      "sourceText": "状況は前と変わらずか。今度こそちゃんと手を打たねえとな",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 32,
      "ordinal": 46,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0373",
      "sourceText": "まあ、そのようなものだ。いないものとして扱ってくれればいい",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 34,
      "ordinal": 48,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0388",
      "sourceText": "おっと、今度はタダじゃ食わせねぇぞ。\n今となっちゃこのコンポタ、\n俺の最後の地元の味なんだからな",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 36,
      "ordinal": 50,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0400",
      "sourceText": "その話をする前に、\n一つ確認しておきたいんだが",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040052,
      "scenarioId": 38,
      "ordinal": 52,
      "stableKey": "s10040052-p29-at0427",
      "sourceText": "予想通りの反応だな……まあ、そりゃそうか",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 4,
      "ordinal": 53,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0444",
      "sourceText": "俺は徽章を探してる。俺を助けてくれた銀髪美少女の持ちモンだ。そしてそいつはフェルトが持ってくる",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 5,
      "ordinal": 54,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0451",
      "sourceText": "徽章……?それも銀髪の女性の？それはもしや……",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 6,
      "ordinal": 55,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0455",
      "sourceText": "俺はそれを買い取りたい。そしてなるべく素早くここを立ち去りたい",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 10,
      "ordinal": 59,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0497",
      "sourceText": "これだよ。『ミーティア』だ。時間空間を切り取って、凍結させることができる",
      "classification": "cutin_occlusion_and_tshirt_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 11,
      "ordinal": 60,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0506p5",
      "sourceText": "これはまた、不可思議な……\nとても興味深い",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 12,
      "ordinal": 61,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0510",
      "sourceText": "スバル、君はこれをいったいどこで？",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 13,
      "ordinal": 62,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0514",
      "sourceText": "元々俺のもんだって。さてどうだ、爺さん。こいつの価値は、どんなもんだ？",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 15,
      "ordinal": 64,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0527",
      "sourceText": "OK、それをフェルトにも説明してもらえると助かる",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 16,
      "ordinal": 65,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0531",
      "sourceText": "ずいぶんと段取りのいいことだ。\nいったい、どれだけ先を考えている？",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 17,
      "ordinal": 66,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0554",
      "sourceText": "確かに、口は良く回るようだが……",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 18,
      "ordinal": 67,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0558",
      "sourceText": "じゃ、フェルトがくるまで、待たせてもらうぜ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 20,
      "ordinal": 69,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0567",
      "sourceText": "ういうい、了解。ユーリも、それでいいよな？",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 21,
      "ordinal": 70,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0571",
      "sourceText": "外だろうと中だろうと、私の仕事は君の護衛だ。問題はないよ",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 22,
      "ordinal": 71,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0576",
      "sourceText": "ああ、頼んだぜ。こっからが、正念場ってやつだ……",
      "classification": "outgoing_wipe_occlusion_and_tshirt_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 25,
      "ordinal": 73,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0589",
      "sourceText": "スバル、ーつ教えてくれ。この交渉、『腸狩り』にどう繋がる？",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 26,
      "ordinal": 74,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0595",
      "sourceText": "……もうじき、エルザがここにくる。フェルトが持ってきた徽章を回収しに、な",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 27,
      "ordinal": 75,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0600",
      "sourceText": "その際、『腸狩り』が暴力に訴える可能性がある、か。そのための私というわけだ",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 28,
      "ordinal": 76,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0605",
      "sourceText": "だが、わざわざ君が徽章を買い取る理由が、わからないな。何故だ？",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 29,
      "ordinal": 77,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0611",
      "sourceText": "それを持ち主に返すためさ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 30,
      "ordinal": 78,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0615",
      "sourceText": "……そうか。いいだろう。今はその答えで納得しておくとするさ",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 31,
      "ordinal": 79,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0620",
      "sourceText": "助かるぜ。じゃ、あとは俺に任せてくれ",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 39,
      "ordinal": 87,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0683",
      "sourceText": "……私はあくまで彼の護衛だ。ただ、そう前置きした上で付け加えるなら、信頼とは砂の城のようなもの",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 40,
      "ordinal": 88,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0689",
      "sourceText": "形作るのは難しく、容易く崩れやすい。君と我々の間でその溝を埋めるのは容易いことではないだろうね",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 42,
      "ordinal": 90,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0701",
      "sourceText": "嫌な方向に意気投合するなよ……",
      "classification": "tshirt_model_variant_and_assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 44,
      "ordinal": 92,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0711",
      "sourceText": "いや？それは早計だ。私は信頼し合うのは困難だと言ったのであって、不可能だと言ったわけではない",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 46,
      "ordinal": 94,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0721",
      "sourceText": "無論、努力は必要だ。だが、困難であることは努力をしない理由にはならない",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": 10040053,
      "scenarioId": 47,
      "ordinal": 95,
      "stableKey": "s10040053-p29-at0725p5",
      "sourceText": "この交渉には意味も意義も見出せる。だから、私は話し合いをまとめるために尽力する。君の質問への答えは以上だ",
      "classification": "assembled_reference_pending",
      "unchanged": true
    }
  ],
